{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/GuKqBjTvTCw\n最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/11pfb44LYlU\n愛って羨ましい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY\n桜橋を教えてくれた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/zrVg31LSLio\n君ばかり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobrCYPb4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "フラゲ日\nいつも応援ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モデルプレスさん、4月の表紙をさせていただいています。\n動く表紙撮影わいわいでした〜。\n新曲についてインタビューしていただきました。\n私たち自身も発売がより楽しみになる、そんな時間でした。ありがとうございました！\n公開をお楽しみに。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングル「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」\n明日4月8日発売です。\nよろしくお願いします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "君ばかり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobnqjPUV.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob29P3vI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと思い出してしまう人って、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobLw2B7w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はこれからできるのだろうか。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（本心は、Same numbersの振り入れをした時に、この曲は髪短くして踊ろうって思った。もうすぐ切って一年が経ってしまうから！そろそろボブ見れなくなると思うよ。よろしくね。）"}], "source": "official"}